@9. Such is the Christian faith concerning the unity of God. (As presented in the Athanasian Creed.)

@24. The unity of God has been inmostly inscribed on the mind of every man. Explained.

@679. It is this unity which causes the preservation of the whole.

@AE 1106[4]. There is a Trinity in God, and also a unity. Explained.

@Ath 169. Thus there is a unity in Trinity, and a Trinity in unity.

@CanonsNC 3. God 1. On the unity of God; or, that there is one God.

@CanonsNC 6. God. 3. 12. In proportion as a man or an Angel acknowledges the unity and the infinity of God, and according to the way in which he does it, he becomes, if he lives well, a receptacle and an image of God.

