@--[end]. These three most universal things (God, good, and truth) are inscribed on (every created thing).

@SE 1076. On universal and singular government. Explained. @2605.

@1830. That universals -universus- correspond to the things in man. Explained.

@2138. The speech of Spirits is a universal speech... @3637[end]. @5585. @5589.

@3549. When I was kept simply in the faith of universal Knowledges...

@4533. On a universal affirmative. General article.

