@1003. "The earth and the world" = the Church as to truth and as to good, thus the universal (or whole) Church.

@DLove 1[2]. For man's love is the universal life. By universal life is meant life in the veriest singulars... That which is thus universal is not perceived otherwise than as a one... Such also is the Divine Universal in the veriest singulars of the world...

