@317. All uses... have a relation to all things of man... and therefore man is the universe in a kind of image; and, conversely, the universe, regarded as to uses, is man in an image. @319, General article.

@319. Man has been called a microcosm... from the fact that he bears relation to the macrocosm, which is the universe in its whole complex. Explained.

